      "title": "Reading the Contrast Carefully",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block_3",
          "text": "The chapter\u2019s contrast between priesthoods and covenants should not be treated as grounds for contempt toward Judaism, denigration of Torah, or erasure of living Jewish communities. Keeping Melchizedek\u2019s role within Hebrews\u2019 literary argument helps readers avoid turning the passage into a claim of Jewish inferiority.",
